          "text": "{\"clauses\":[{\"name\":\"Parties\",\"start_line\":10,\"end_line\":13,\"head\":\"This Agreement is by and between Argus Research\",\"tail\":\"at 93 Shepperton Road, London NI 3DF, England.\"},{\"name\":\"1. Amendment of Goods and Services\",\"start_line\":28,\"end_line\":47,\"head\":\"1. Petroleum Argus Limited shall amend the identification\",\"tail\":\"relating to stocks and bonds, in Class 36.\"},{\"name\":\"2. Non-Opposition to PETROLEUM ARGUS\",\"start_line\":49,\"end_line\":63,\"head\":\"2. Argus Research Group, Inc. will not oppose\",\"tail\":\"do any act or thing in derogation thereof.\"},{\"name\":\"3. Non-Opposition to ENERGY ARGUS\",\"start_line\":65,\"end_line\":70,\"head\":\"3. Argus Research Group, Inc. will not oppose\",\"tail\":\"do any act or thing in derogation thereof.\"},{\"name\":\"4. Governing Law\",\"start_line\":72,\"end_line\":75,\"head\":\"4. This agreement and the performance of shall\",\"tail\":\"to the United States, its territories and possessions.\"},{\"name\":\"5. Binding Effect\",\"start_line\":77,\"end_line\":78,\"head\":\"5. This agreement is binding upon and inures\",\"tail\":\"of the parties, their successors, licensees and assigns.\"},{\"name\":\"6. Entire Agreement and Modification\",\"start_line\":80,\"end_line\":80,\"head\":\"6. This is the entire agreement and may\",\"tail\":\"modified only in writing signed by both parties.\"},{\"name\":\"7. Costs and Attorneys’ Fees\",\"start_line\":82,\"end_line\":82,\"head\":\"7. Both parties will pay all their own costs in attorneys’ fees.\",\"tail\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"8. Confidentiality\",\"start_line\":84,\"end_line\":85,\"head\":\"8. The parties will agree to keep the\",\"tail\":\"and/or state and federal rules of civil procedure.\"}]}",
